0.1651 20.816 69.8121 20.0783 69.5598 19.0275C69.3062 17.9768 69.1813 16.5014 69.1813 14.6013C69.1813 12.7012 69.3074 11.2622 69.5598 10.2211C69.8121 9.1801 70.1664 8.46302 70.6201 8.06869C71.075 7.67435 71.6452 7.47779 72.3331 7.47779C73.0209 7.47779 73.596 7.69012 74.0606 8.11479C74.5253 8.53946 74.8832 9.28202 75.1367 10.3425C75.3891 11.4029 75.5152 12.8735 75.5152 14.753C75.5152 16.6324 75.3891 18.0933 75.1367 19.1331V19.1343Z"
              />
              <path
                fill="currentColor"
                opacity="0.72"
                d="M6.20053 14.4812L5.691 16.1483L5.48719 16.8156C5.44715 16.9248 5.40954 17.0352 5.37315 17.1457H18.7569L17.7318 14.2324H6.27575L6.20053 14.4812Z"
              />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="ps-brand__sub">AIOS Data Products</span>
        </a>
      </li>

      <!-- 2. ByteDance Lynx -->
      <li class="ps-brand">
        <a
          href="https://lynxjs.org/react/genui/a2ui.html"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="ps-brand__inner"
          aria-label="ByteDance — Lynx Engine"
        >
          <div class="ps-brand__lockup">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="19" height="19" aria-hidden="true">
              <path
                fill="currentColor"
                d="M19.8772 1.4685L24 2.5326v18.9426l-4.1228 1.0563V1.4685zm-13.3481 9.428l4.115 1.0641v8.9786l-4.115 1.0642v-11.107zM0 2.572l4.115 1.0642v16.7354L0 21.428V2.572zm17.4553 5.6205v11.107l-4.1228-1.0642V9.2568l4.1228-1.0642z"
              />
            </svg>
            <span class="ps-brand__name">ByteDance</span>
          </div>
          <span class="ps-brand__sub">Lynx Engine</span>
        </a>
      </li>

      <!-- 3. Atlassian Jira -->
      <li class="ps-brand">
        <a
          href="https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/work-with-ai-agents-in-jira/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="ps-brand__inner"
          aria-label="Atlassian — Jira AI Agents"
        >
          <div class="ps-brand__lockup">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true">
              <path
                fill="currentColor"
                d="M7.12 11.084a.683.683 0 00-1.16.126L.075 22.974a.703.703 0 00.63 1.018h8.19a.678.678 0 00.63-.39c1.767-3.65.696-9.203-2.406-12.52zM11.434.386a15.515 15.515 0 00-.906 15.317l3.95 7.9a.703.703 0 00.628.388h8.19a.703.703 0 00.63-1.017L12.63.38a.664.664 0 00-1.196.006z"
              />
            </svg>
            <span class="ps-brand__name">Atlassian</span>
          </div>
          <span class="ps-brand__sub">Jira AI Agents</span>
        </a>
      </li>

      <!-- 4. Google Cloud Gemini Enterprise -->
      <li class="ps-brand">
        <a
          href="https://cloud.google.com/gemini-enterprise"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="ps-brand__inner"
          aria-label="Google Cloud — Gemini Enterprise"
        >
          <div class="ps-brand__lockup">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true">
              <path
                fill="currentColor"
                d="M12.19 2.38a9.344 9.344 0 0 0-9.234 6.893c.053-.02-.055.013 0 0-3.875 2.551-3.922 8.11-.247 10.941l.006-.007-.007.03a6.717 6.717 0 0 0 4.077 1.356h5.173l.03.03h5.192c6.687.053 9.376-8.605 3.835-12.35a9.365 9.365 0 0 0-2.821-4.552l-.043.043.006-.05A9.344 9.344 0 0 0 12.19 2.38zm-.358 4.146c1.244-.04 2.518.368 3.486 1.15a5.186 5.186 0 0 1 1.862 4.078v.518c3.53-.07 3.53 5.262 0 5.193h-5.193l-.008.009v-.04H6.785a2.59 2.59 0 0 1-1.067-.23h.001a2.597 2.597 0 1 1 3.437-3.437l3.013-3.012A6.747 6.747 0 0 0 8.11 8.24c.018-.01.04-.026.054-.023a5.186 5.186 0 0 1 3.67-1.69z"
              />
            </svg>
            <span class="ps-brand__name">Google Cloud</span>
          </div>
          <span class="ps-brand__sub">Gemini Enterprise</span>
        </a>
      </li>

      <!-- 5. Gemini Notebook -->
      <li class="ps-brand">
        <div class="ps-brand__inner">
          <div class="ps-brand__lockup">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="19" height="19" aria-hidden="true">
              <path
                fill="currentColor"
                d="M12 1.8C12.42 7.38 16.62 11.58 22.2 12C16.62 12.42 12.42 16.62 12 22.2C11.58 16.62 7.38 12.42 1.8 12C7.38 11.58 11.58 7.38 12 1.8Z"
              />
            </svg>
            <span class="ps-brand__name">Gemini</span>
          </div>
          <span class="ps-brand__sub">Gemini Notebook</span>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <!-- Restrained 2-column partner quotes (only where quotes exist) -->
    <div class="ps-quotes">
      <blockquote class="ps-quote">
        <p>
          "The Alation Intelligence Operating System (AIOS) brings artifacts with data, charts, and
          insights directly to where teams work with transparency about where each figure comes
          from. A2UI provides the interactive UI scaffolding that makes these artifacts feel like
          high-touch, tailored applications, whether they are used in Alation or in the AI
          Assistants our customers already use."
        </p>
        <footer>
          <strong>GT Volpe</strong>
          <span>VP of Product Management, Alation</span>
        </footer>
      </blockquote>

      <blockquote class="ps-quote">
        <p>
          "A2UI is headed in the right direction: it separates how a model produces an interface
          from how an app renders it. Swappable inference formats and macros keep generation
          efficient, and even the model can be swapped. In our playground, a decision model like
          Jev, which picks components and values instead of writing text, builds A2UI screens that
          Lynx renders natively."
        </p>
        <footer>
          <strong>Shouqun Liu</strong>
          <span>Engineering Lead for Lynx, ByteDance</span>
        </footer>
      </blockquote>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .ps-section {
    position: relative;
    padding: 96px 0 104px;
    background: var(--a2-bg-alt);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--a2-border-strong);
    scroll-margin-top: 72px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .ps-section {
      padding: 72px 0 80px;
    }
  }

  .ps-wrap {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 36px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .ps-wrap {
      padding: 0 20px;
    }
  }

  /* Compact single-axis header */
  .ps-head {
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .ps-h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--a2-font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.85rem, 3vw, 2.45rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: var(--a2-tracking-h2);
    color: var(--a2-text);
  }

  .ps-accent {
    color: var(--a2-heading-accent);
  }

  /* Architectural 5-cell brand grid */
  .ps-brands {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(5, minmax(0, 1fr));
    border: 1px solid var(--a2-border-strong);
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: var(--a2-bg);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .ps-brand + .ps-brand {
    border-left: 1px solid var(--a2-border);
  }

  @media (max-width: 980px) {
    .ps-brands {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(6, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }

    .ps-brand:nth-child(-n + 3) {
      grid-column: span 2;
    }

    .ps-brand:nth-child(n + 4) {
      grid-column: span 3;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--a2-border);
    }

    .ps-brand:nth-child(4) {
      border-left: none;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .ps-brands {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }

    .ps-brand {
      grid-column: span 1 !important;
      border-left: none !important;
      border-top: none !important;
    }

    .ps-brand:nth-child(even) {
      border-left: 1px solid var(--a2-border) !important;
    }

    .ps-brand:nth-child(n + 3) {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--a2-border) !important;
    }

    .ps-brand:last-child {
      grid-column: 1 / -1 !important;
    }
  }

  .ps-brand__inner {
    height: 100%;
    min-height: 104px;
    padding: 24px 20px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 10px;
    text-align: center;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--a2-text);
    transition: background-color 0.16s ease, color 0.16s ease;
  }

  a.ps-brand__inner:hover {
    background: var(--a2-surface-raised);
  }

  .ps-brand__lockup {
    height: 24px;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 9px;
    color: var(--a2-text);
    opacity: 0.88;
    transition: opacity 0.16s ease, color 0.16s ease;
  }

  a.ps-brand__inner:hover .ps-brand__lockup {
    opacity: 1;
    color: var(--a2-accent-strong);
  }

  .ps-wordmark-svg {
    display: block;
    width: auto;
    height: 19px;
  }

  .ps-brand__name {
    font-family: var(--a2-font-display);
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 680;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    line-height: 1;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .ps-brand__sub {
    font-family: var(--a2-font-mono);
    font-size: 10.5px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    color: var(--a2-text-muted);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  /* Restrained 2-column quotes */
  .ps-quotes {
    margin-top: 40px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    column-gap: 64px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .ps-quote {
    position: relative;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 14px;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .ps-quote + .ps-quote::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 2px;
    bottom: 2px;
    left: -32px;
    width: 1px;
    background: var(--a2-border);
  }

  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .ps-quotes {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      row-gap: 28px;
      margin-top: 32px;
    }

    .ps-quote + .ps-quote {
      padding-top: 28px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--a2-border);
    }

    .ps-quote + .ps-quote::before {
      display: none;
    }
  }

  .ps-quote p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.66;
    color: var(--a2-text-secondary);
  }

  .ps-quote footer {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 6px 10px;
    font-size: 12.5px;
  }

  .ps-quote strong {
    font-weight: 650;
    color: var(--a2-text);
  }

  .ps-quote span {
    font-family: var(--a2-font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--a2-text-muted);
  }
</style>
